  look 1 "${k}b${r} turns it over: the sinks first, the changed symbols that use nothing else changed (daysSince, the constants), each opening to what uses it. New pieces before the plumbing that carries them, for when you want to judge the parts before the wiring."
  look 2 "${k}s${r} is the shape of it, in the preview: seam's score of what makes this change hard to read. How many separate stories, how deep the chain goes, how many interfaces changed, how many definitions are only a body edit and so safe. Worth a look before a big MR, to know whether it is one change or a sweep of unrelated ones. The next tour is six branches that each score badly a different way."
